#: gnusteampacker/main.py:70
msgid "A Linux-native GUI for downloading, cleaning, and packaging Steam games for archival and sharing. Spiritual port of <a href=\"https://github.com/Masquerade64/SuperSteamPacker\">SuperSteamPacker</a>."
msgstr "Une interface native Linux pour télécharger, nettoyer et empaqueter des jeux Steam pour l'archivage et le partage. Port spirituel de <a href=\"https://github.com/Masquerade64/SuperSteamPacker\">SuperSteamPacker</a>."

